# ELI path | programme | article | audit procedure | requested evidence | article | audit procedure | requested evidence
reg/2022/2065|Digital Services Act|16|Trace a notice of illegal content from intake to the platform’s decision|Submitted notice, timestamps and decision record|17|Reconstruct the explanation given for a content restriction|Restriction record and the statement sent to the affected recipient
